 ## How it works
 **Inputs and Outputs:**
-- Input: A set of sample values and their positions relative to the reconstruction point.
-- Output: The interpolated value at the target position.
+- Input: Discrete sample values and their spatial coordinates [G].
+- Output: The interpolated value at the target reconstruction point [G].
 
